  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Lab 1000 YOUTH EMPLOYMENT\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 276-A:8\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #5492, eff 10-20-92 made extensive changes to the wording, format, structure, and numbering of rules in Chapter Lab 1000. The prior filings for former Chapter Lab 1000 include the following documents:\n\n#1537, eff 2-20-80\n\n#2515, eff 10-25-93\n\n#4018, eff 3-21-86, EXPIRED: 3-21-92",
